# 🛍️ StyleHub - E-Commerce Backend

## 📋 Project Overview

**StyleHub** एक Fashion E-Commerce Backend है जो Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB का उपयोग करके बनाया गया है। यह एक Production-Ready API है जिसमें Authentication, Products, Categories, Cart, Orders, और Payment Integration शामिल है।

### 🚀 Tech Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|------------|---------|---------|
| Node.js | v20.x | Runtime Environment |
| Express.js | v4.19.2 | Web Framework |
| MongoDB | v8.5.1 | Database |
| Mongoose | v8.5.1 | ODM for MongoDB |
| JWT | v9.0.2 | Authentication |
| Bcryptjs | v2.4.3 | Password Hashing |
| Nodemailer | v6.9.14 | Email Service |
| Razorpay | v2.0.0 | Payment Gateway |
| Multer | v1.4.5-lts.1 | File Upload |
| Cloudinary | v2.2.0 | Image Storage |

