## 🔐 **1. Authentication Module** (`authController.js`)

### 📍 **Purpose**
User Authentication और Authorization का पूरा System।

### 🎯 **Key Features**
- ✅ Admin Login (Password-based)
- ✅ Customer OTP Login (Email-based)
- ✅ JWT Token Generation
- ✅ Cookie-based Authentication
- ✅ Logout Functionality
- ✅ Current User Fetching

### 📋 **APIs**

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Access |
|--------|----------|-------------|--------|
| POST | `/api/auth/admin/login` | Admin Login with Password | Public |
| POST | `/api/auth/send-otp` | Send OTP to Email | Public |
| POST | `/api/auth/verify-otp` | Verify OTP & Login/Register | Public |
| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | Logout User | Private |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get Current User | Private |
| GET | `/api/auth/check` | Check Authentication Status | Private |

### 🛠️ **How It Works**

**Admin Flow:**
Admin enters email & password

Backend validates credentials

JWT Token generated

Token stored in httpOnly Cookie

Admin logged in

text

**Customer Flow:**
Customer enters email

Backend generates 6-digit OTP

OTP sent via Email

Customer enters OTP

Backend verifies OTP

JWT Token generated

Customer logged in/registered

