💳 6. Payment Module (paymentController.js)
📍 Purpose
Online Payment Processing (Razorpay).

🎯 Key Features
✅ Create Razorpay Order

✅ Payment Verification

✅ Payment Status Check

✅ COD Support (Already in Order)

✅ Secure Signature Verification

📋 APIs
Method	Endpoint	Description	Access
POST	/api/payments/create-order	Create Razorpay Order	Customer
POST	/api/payments/verify	Verify Payment	Customer
GET	/api/payments/status/:orderId	Get Payment Status	Customer
📊 Payment Flow
text
1. Customer creates order (paymentMethod: 'online')
2. Create Razorpay Order → Get razorpayOrderId
3. Frontend opens Razorpay Checkout
4. Customer completes payment
5. Razorpay sends payment response
6. Backend verifies payment signature
7. Update order paymentStatus: 'paid'
8. Update order orderStatus: 'confirmed'
📊 Example Request
Create Razorpay Order:

json
// Request
POST /api/payments/create-order
{
  "orderId": "67a8b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d999"
}

// Response
